      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "UI LAYER (React Components)\n\n\u2022 Chessboard (Squares, Pieces, Legal Dots, Arrows)\n\u2022 EnginePanel (Eval Bar, Win Prob %, Depth, NPS)\n\u2022 GameReview (Move Classification: Brilliant -> Blunder)\n\u2022 NeuralHeatmap (8x8 Territory / Attack Matrix)\n\u2022 PersonaSelect (Aggressive, Positional, Master Bots)\n\u2022 SoundManager (Move, Capture, Check, Castle)",
