      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LOCAL ENGINE FALLBACK (Web Worker)\n\n\u2022 workerEngine.js (Worker Bridge)\n\u2022 chess.worker.js (Dedicated Web Worker Thread)\n\u2022 JS Minimax + Alpha-Beta Search (Depth 3-5)\n\u2022 Quiescence Search + Transposition Table (60k Map)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": "2cc9731f-d8f4-4a58-8549-4db1c04e3ddc",
      "originalText": "LOCAL ENGINE FALLBACK (Web Worker)\n\n\u2022 workerEngine.js (Worker Bridge)\n\u2022 chess.worker.js (Dedicated Web Worker Thread)\n\u2022 JS Minimax + Alpha-Beta Search (Depth 3-5)\n\u2022 Quiescence Search + Transposition Table (60k Map)",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
