      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SERVER CORE (server.cpp / server.hpp)\n\n\u2022 POSIX Socket Multi-threaded HTTP Listener\n\u2022 JSON Request/Response Parser & Serializer\n\u2022 Thread-safe Search Execution (std::mutex search_mutex)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
