    {
      "id": "2c7bdc90-1176-41b1-9eb0-a54e91416f70",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 870,
      "y": 335.85,
      "width": 535.3399999999999,
      "height": 118.3,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#89dceb",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1055,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1056,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "BOARD REPRESENTATION & BITBOARDS (position.cpp / chess_types.hpp)\n\n\u2022 64-bit Bitboards (uint64_t bb[2][7] \u2014 White/Black x PieceType)\n\u2022 Hardware Bit-twiddling: pop_lsb(), lsb() via __builtin_ctzll\n\u2022 Legal Move Generator: Pseudo-legal ray attacks + King Safety Check\n\u2022 Fast Square Attacks: is_attacked(), is_in_check() for checks and pins\n\u2022 64-bit Zobrist Hash Keys (zobrist.cpp) for position transposition",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": "534aefd8-d127-48f6-92a7-1422f3e6f9dc",
      "originalText": "BOARD REPRESENTATION & BITBOARDS (position.cpp / chess_types.hpp)\n\n\u2022 64-bit Bitboards (uint64_t bb[2][7] \u2014 White/Black x PieceType)\n\u2022 Hardware Bit-twiddling: pop_lsb(), lsb() via __builtin_ctzll\n\u2022 Legal Move Generator: Pseudo-legal ray attacks + King Safety Check\n\u2022 Fast Square Attacks: is_attacked(), is_in_check() for checks and pins\n\u2022 64-bit Zobrist Hash Keys (zobrist.cpp) for position transposition",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "3c2fa93b-2e60-43ae-888b-d2e5fd52eb96",
      "type": "rectangle",
