    {
      "id": "4041bd3a-f39f-4d94-a357-6bde025d1627",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 870,
      "y": 563.6,
      "width": 625.8199999999999,
      "height": 202.8,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#cba6f7",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1059,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1060,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SEARCH PIPELINE (search.cpp / search.hpp)\n\n\u2022 Iterative Deepening: Depth 1 -> 2 -> ... -> Target Depth\n\u2022 Multi-PV Root Search: Extracts top 3 candidate moves & lines\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500 6-LAYER TOURNAMENT SEARCH ENGINE \u2500\u2500\u2500\n[Layer 1] Minimax Recursion \u2014 Maximizer (White) vs Minimizer (Black)\n[Layer 2] Alpha-Beta Pruning \u2014 Alpha/Beta bounds, immediate beta cutoffs\n[Layer 3] Quiescence Search \u2014 Tactical captures, Delta Pruning (margin 975cp)\n[Layer 4] Move Ordering \u2014 TT Best Move -> MVV-LVA -> Killer Moves -> History\n[Layer 5] Transposition Table \u2014 1M Entries, Zobrist Hash, EXACT/LOWER/UPPER\n[Layer 6] Advanced Pruning \u2014 Null Move Pruning (R=2/3) + Late Move Reductions (LMR)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": "3c2fa93b-2e60-43ae-888b-d2e5fd52eb96",
      "originalText": "SEARCH PIPELINE (search.cpp / search.hpp)\n\n\u2022 Iterative Deepening: Depth 1 -> 2 -> ... -> Target Depth\n\u2022 Multi-PV Root Search: Extracts top 3 candidate moves & lines\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500 6-LAYER TOURNAMENT SEARCH ENGINE \u2500\u2500\u2500\n[Layer 1] Minimax Recursion \u2014 Maximizer (White) vs Minimizer (Black)\n[Layer 2] Alpha-Beta Pruning \u2014 Alpha/Beta bounds, immediate beta cutoffs\n[Layer 3] Quiescence Search \u2014 Tactical captures, Delta Pruning (margin 975cp)\n[Layer 4] Move Ordering \u2014 TT Best Move -> MVV-LVA -> Killer Moves -> History\n[Layer 5] Transposition Table \u2014 1M Entries, Zobrist Hash, EXACT/LOWER/UPPER\n[Layer 6] Advanced Pruning \u2014 Null Move Pruning (R=2/3) + Late Move Reductions (LMR)",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
